# #5837, the claimless advance and the split hint.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestFreeAdvanceViewBeforeHeads
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the free advance reads its marker view before its target is fixed, so a window opened and closed in between is missed
PERTURBS: FreeTarget
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ ft[a] # Max(mine[a])
    /\ ft' = [ft EXCEPT ![a] = Max(mine[a])]
--- REPLACE
    /\ ft[a] # Max(mine[a])
\* MUTATION: the view is read here, before the target.
    /\ mInit
    /\ ~hoOpen
    /\ rp[a] >= hoClosedAt - 1
    /\ ft' = [ft EXCEPT ![a] = Max(mine[a])]
--- END

--- FIND
    /\ ft[a] > rp[a]
    /\ mInit
    /\ ~hoOpen
    /\ rp[a] >= hoClosedAt - 1
    /\ rp[a] >= seenP[a]
    /\ rp[a] >= seenU[a]
    /\ pend => rp[a] >= seenS[a]
    /\ \A o \in inflight : author[o] = a => o > ft[a]
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT ![a] = ft[a]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ ft[a] > rp[a]
    /\ rp[a] >= seenP[a]
    /\ rp[a] >= seenU[a]
    /\ pend => rp[a] >= seenS[a]
    /\ \A o \in inflight : author[o] # a
\* MUTATION: the target is taken now, after the view.
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT ![a] = Max(mine[a])]
--- END
